octantvector-mert

Copied files
  src/octantvector_mert/modeling_MERT.py
  src/octantvector_mert/configuration_MERT.py
from the Hugging Face repository m-a-p/MERT-v1-95M (https://huggingface.co/m-a-p/MERT-v1-95M) at revision
12af15fef9d0ac838c3f475bfbbf26d2060dd4f5. Their content is unchanged except for a comment block added at the top of
each (source, revision, licence). The upstream files carry no licence header; the repository is published under
CC BY-NC 4.0.

Upstream notes: modeling_MERT.py says it largely adapts
  - transformers' HuBERT (src/transformers/models/hubert/modeling_hubert.py), Apache License 2.0,
    https://github.com/huggingface/transformers
  - fairseq's wav2vec 2.0 (fairseq/models/wav2vec/wav2vec2.py), MIT License, https://github.com/facebookresearch/fairseq
Their licence texts are in licenses/: transformers-Apache-2.0.txt (Apache License 2.0) and fairseq-MIT.txt
(Copyright (c) Facebook, Inc. and its affiliates).

The model weights (pytorch_model.bin) are not included; `octantharvest models` downloads them into models_dir.
